# Only what the build needs goes into the image build context (apps/web).
# `**/`: patterns are anchored to the context root; `**/` also matches nested folders.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-e2e
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
.husky
.claude
.zed
.vscode
.idea
# never bake local config / secrets into an image: pass VITE_* as --build-arg
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
*.log
